  "details": "Hello,\n\nSince the introduction of the new input system and the new bindings, some actions are now missing. In particular, the distinction between left and right is missing.\n\nBefore, I could use an action on the LEFT hand to open the radial menu on the RIGHT hand, for example. But now the menu only opens on the hand on which the action (e.g. double-press button) was performed. Yes, I know I had crazy autistic bindings, but I'm having a hard time right now.\n\nCan you add the separate (left/right) actions again?",
